# Google OAuth 2.0 Credentials
# Get these from Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials)
# Authorized JavaScript origin: https://zebar.zenstro.space
# Authorized redirect URI: https://zebar.zenstro.space/api/auth/callback/google
